//---------------------------------------------------------------------
// name: type-type.ck
// desc: this example shows working with the Type type in ChucK;
//       a Type instance represents a specific type currently in
//       in the ChucK VM
//
// version: needs 1.5.0.0 or higher
//
// author: Ge Wang (https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~ge/)
// date: Winter 2023
